{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"You hold the crackers up high.|Deer crowd in."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone freezes.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Park rules.|Follow them."},{"id":"s4","text":"Hold them low.|Let them bow."},{"id":"s5","text":"She smiles.|Low, please."},{"id":"s6","text":"She—"},{"id":"s7","text":"You wait.|The deer bows."},{"id":"s8","text":"One gentle bite.|No headbutt."},{"id":"s9","text":"Low hands. Happy deer."},{"id":"n1","text":"Crackers low.|Deer bow."},{"id":"n2","text":"No teasing.|No headbutts."},{"id":"n3","text":"Two hundred yen.|Worth the bow."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}